    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d531">

                <pb facs="0732" n="644" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg644"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Bolet Peraza to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Venezuela</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                                York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-09-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 21, 1892</hi></date>. (Received
                        September 21.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>The acquittal of Gonzales does not disprove charge that the vessel <hi
                        rendition="#italic">South Portland</hi> is armed to be used against my
                    Government. I urge the libelling of the vessel. Will you so direct and detain
                    her? If you require it will personally visit you and present my proofs
                    to-morrow. Please answer by telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. Bolet Peraza.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
